# DATABASE

Use MySQL + Sequelize.

Prefer UUID or the project's approved key strategy consistently.

Company-owned tables must have tenant/company ownership.

Use:
primary keys
foreign keys
unique constraints
indexes
timestamps
audit fields
appropriate soft-delete strategy where required

Use migrations.

Prefer additive schema changes.

Do not drop or rename production columns without an explicit migration strategy.

Inventory and accounting data require strong transactional integrity.
